; Claude: MiniCampaigns: retail team-vs-team missions as a single-player campaign (docs/MINI_CAMPAIGNS.md).
; +Player Team: is read by this project only: 1 flies Alpha (team 1), 2 flies Zeta (team 2).
$Name: FS2 TvT: Alpha Side
$Type: single
+Description:
The FreeSpace 2 team-vs-team missions, flown as a single-player campaign on the Alpha side. Your wingmates and the other team are flown by the AI. Lose a mission and you fly it again.
$end_multi_text
+Player Team: 1

+Starting Ships: ( "GTB Artemis"  "GTB Boanerges"  "GTB Medusa"  "GTB Ursa"  "GTB Zeus"  "GTF Erinyes"  "GTF Hercules"  "GTF Hercules Mark II"  "GTF Loki"  "GTF Myrmidon"  "GTF Pegasus"  "GTF Perseus"  "GTF Ulysses"  "GVB Bakha"  "GVB Osiris"  "GVB Sekhmet"  "GVF Horus"  "GVF Ptah"  "GVF Serapis"  "GVF Seth"  "GVF Tauret"  "GVF Thoth" )

